<title>USA: Bank of Commerce, Fallbrook plan rejected.</title>
<headline>Bank of Commerce, Fallbrook plan rejected.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO, Calif 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Commerce said Wednesday that Fallbrook National Bank has rejected its acquisition proposal.</p>
<p>&quot;Despite the action by the board of Fallbrook National Bank, Bank of Commerce is determined to pursue its proposal through all appropriate means,&quot; the company said in a release.</p>
<p>The proposed stock pact had called for Bank of Commerce to acquire Fallbrook by exchanging two Bank of Commerce shares for five shares of Fallbrook.</p>
</text>
